---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Sneat Games tech stack — one catalog, many places to play"
  description="How Astro, typed bilingual content, and Cloudflare static assets connect Sneat Games to browser and Telegram games."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Sneat Games</p>
      <h1>The technology behind Sneat Games</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This site is a map of places to play. Some games open in a browser,
        others in Telegram, and a game can have both homes. The catalog gives
        each game one card and shows which places are playable now.
      </p>

      <h2>A small, bilingual front door</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> builds the English and Russian
        pages as static files. The shared <code>@sneat/astro</code> layout supplies
        the language switcher, page metadata and matching language links.
        TypeScript copy modules hold each game's description and platform
        status, so a “coming soon” destination does not become a dead link.
      </p>

      <h2>From one card to the right game</h2>
      <p>
        Cards point to each browser game's own address or to a Telegram bot deep
        link. A game with two ways to play still has one place in the catalog.
        Browser releases can also be pinned by version and SHA-256 in the site's
        game lockfile before their files are bundled under a game path. This
        keeps the catalog's deployment tied to an exact game build.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cloudflare Workers serves the finished site as static assets. Asset
        redirects send short English addresses to their canonical pages, and
        Astro generates a sitemap for both languages.
        <a href="/#games">Browse the games</a> to pick a playable destination.
      </p>

      <p class="back"><a href="/">← Back to Sneat Games</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 760px; }
  .prose h1 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: var(--space-4); }
  .lede { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .back { margin-top: var(--space-4); font-weight: 600; }
</style>
